{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DefaultFormOptions = Pick<FormOptions<unknown, FormValidators<unknown>, unknown, unknown>, \"errorVisibility\" | \"listeners\" | \"onSubmitInvalid\"> & DefaultListenersMergeOptions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L58","children":[{"type":"text","value":"defaultOptions.public.ts:58"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reusable form behavior that does not participate in form value inference."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"errorVisibility"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"listeners"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmitInvalid"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"listenersMerge"},{"type":"text","value":"\ncan be shared this way. Callback values are typed as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", so behavior\nthat depends on the inferred form value should remain in the usage-site form\noptions. Usage-site properties override defaults even when explicitly set\nto "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"; a supplied listener array instead follows "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"listenersMerge"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const formDefaults: DefaultFormOptions = {\n  errorVisibility: ({ fieldState }) => fieldState.meta.isBlurred,\n  listenersMerge: 'append',\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')?.focus()\n  },\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefaultFormOptions = Pick<FormOptions<unknown, FormValidators<unknown>, unknown, unknown>, \"errorVisibility\" | \"listeners\" | \"onSubmitInvalid\"> & DefaultListenersMergeOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L58)\n\nReusable form behavior that does not participate in form value inference.\n\nOnly `errorVisibility`, `listeners`, `onSubmitInvalid`, and `listenersMerge`\ncan be shared this way. Callback values are typed as `unknown`, so behavior\nthat depends on the inferred form value should remain in the usage-site form\noptions. Usage-site properties override defaults even when explicitly set\nto `undefined`; a supplied listener array instead follows `listenersMerge`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst formDefaults: DefaultFormOptions = {\n  errorVisibility: ({ fieldState }) => fieldState.meta.isBlurred,\n  listenersMerge: 'append',\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefaultFormOptions\ntitle: DefaultFormOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefaultFormOptions = Pick<FormOptions<unknown, FormValidators<unknown>, unknown, unknown>, \"errorVisibility\" | \"listeners\" | \"onSubmitInvalid\"> & DefaultListenersMergeOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L58)\n\nReusable form behavior that does not participate in form value inference.\n\nOnly `errorVisibility`, `listeners`, `onSubmitInvalid`, and `listenersMerge`\ncan be shared this way. Callback values are typed as `unknown`, so behavior\nthat depends on the inferred form value should remain in the usage-site form\noptions. Usage-site properties override defaults even when explicitly set\nto `undefined`; a supplied listener array instead follows `listenersMerge`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst formDefaults: DefaultFormOptions = {\n  errorVisibility: ({ fieldState }) => fieldState.meta.isBlurred,\n  listenersMerge: 'append',\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n"}
